WEBVTT

00:10:57.537 --> 00:11:00.537
Abed had been less handsome
than substantial,

00:11:00.579 --> 00:11:04.246
with thick black hair
and a full face and a wide neck.

00:11:04.246 --> 00:11:07.537
It was this youth who on May 16, 1990,

00:11:07.579 --> 00:11:09.412
had broken two necks including mine,

00:11:09.454 --> 00:11:12.204
and bruised one brain and taken one life.

00:11:13.454 --> 00:11:16.162
Twenty-one years later,
he was now thinner than his wife,

00:11:16.162 --> 00:11:17.662
his skin slack on his face,

00:11:17.662 --> 00:11:20.454
and looking at Abed
looking at his young self,

00:11:20.496 --> 00:11:23.954
I remembered looking at that photograph
of my young self after the crash,

00:11:23.954 --> 00:11:25.871
and recognized his longing.

00:11:27.037 --> 00:11:29.912
"The crash changed
both of our lives," I said.